# Files that must never enter the API image or the build context.
#
# docker-compose.yml and CI build with the repository root as context
# (`docker build -f backend/Dockerfile .`). Docker reads ignore rules from `<context>/.dockerignore`
# (or, with BuildKit, from `backend/Dockerfile.dockerignore`), so to make these rules effective for
# the root context copy this file to the repository root as `.dockerignore` or symlink
# `backend/Dockerfile.dockerignore` to it. The paths below are written relative to the root.
.git
.github
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
*.db
*.db-journal
.audio_tmp
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
models
kb/downloads
web
reports
eval
docs
backend/tests
backend/mila.egg-info
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
